Error [jet.InvalidFixedListLength]: `Direction` is a type, not a fixed-size list length
  --> tests/ui/fixed_length_enum_name.jet:11:12
    |
 11 |     short: [Int#Direction]{10, 20}
    |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A fixed-size list `[T#N]` takes a compile-time integer length: a literal or an integer constant
 Fix: Write the length as an integer, like `[T#2]`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0963
